  "synopsis": "Wen Yifan unexpectedly runs into Sang Yan at a bar. Back in high school, Sang Yan—then the school’s most popular boy—had liked her, but she hurt him. By a twist of fate, the two end up renting rooms under the same roof. At first, Sang Yan is aloof and distant, and Wen Yifan finds him difficult to get along with. But as they spend more time together, she grows increasingly fond of him. Sang Yan, meanwhile, has loved her ever since high school.\n\nEventually, they confess their feelings and realize their love is mutual. Together, they also confront the painful shadow of Wen Yifan’s family life during high school.\n\n(Source: Bilibili)",
